title: Opening Sequence — Path D: Alarm-On Collision Death
story: no-signal-home
description: Tests the 10-turn alarm timer — never silence the alarm, die on collision

---

## Waste turns without silencing the alarm — death at turn 10
## Some commands (look, inventory) may be free actions, so we add extras

> examine crates
[OK: contains "DEEP REACH SALVAGE"]

> examine bedroll
[OK: contains "sleeping pad"]

> examine datapad
[OK: contains "DRIFT MODE"]

> take flashlight
[OK: contains_any "flashlight" "Taken"]

> take ration bar
[OK: contains_any "ration" "Taken"]

> drop flashlight
[OK: contains_any "Dropped" "dropped" "flashlight"]

> take flashlight
[OK: contains_any "flashlight" "Taken"]

> drop ration bar
[OK: contains_any "Dropped" "dropped" "ration"]

> take ration bar
[OK: contains_any "ration" "Taken"]

## Move to cockpit

> south
[OK: contains "Tug Cockpit"]

> examine fuel gauge
[OK: contains_any "fuel" "percent" "three"]

## By now turn count should be >= 10 — collision death

> examine instrument panels
[OK: contains_any "alarm screams" "DIED" "collision" "hull"]
[EVENT: true, type="game.ended" reason="death"]
